    "description": "What: AQ104 K (CE-2371) - on bt-range, 'Guard' (Hostile rifleman, mortal) defends the area round House A (centre (105.6,97), ~25 m) - AQ104 L (CE-2373): the one man of 'Guard Post' (SquadDefend over the area): posts chosen for COVERAGE, a guard round between them while nothing is known (\u23ed AQ104 A: the order straight on the man) - two parked cars by the centre;'Blue South' (from (106,5)) and 'Blue East' (from (195,98)), ~90 m out, each CLEAR the area (ClearArea on a lone man: his own squad is created first, AQ104 A-1) - they must find him (mortal). Judge (240 s): (1) the guard sees each attacker before he is within 30 m of the centre; (2) the guard fires first at each; (3) printed: where the guard stood over time and what he could see. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ia-area-defend. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_104_Area_And_Building_Combat.md \u00a74 K"
